title: EMR Connect › Field mappings › Every mapping by system
route: /emr
intro: The field mappings list in the folded 'Advanced' section: every mapping with its system, what each of their fields fills in Psyflo, who mapped it, and the fields that still wait. A newly connected system starts with none.
dir: TD
also: Seed data. 'Mapped by' reads 'Reader, 03/14' for the agents and 'You, {date}' for a person. Dates come from the Demo clock. A chart pulled in New Case leaves a waiting field blank (Level of care, Referral source) and fills a mapped one. The list is one list with the system named under each row, and it shows only the systems at the sites in view (Site A's viewer sees 7 mappings, Site B's 5, Both sites 10); the Manage drawer no longer holds mappings.
---
start s1 "Open 'Advanced'\nThen read 'Field mappings'"
screen t0 "Field mappings\n'{n} mapped, {m} waiting. A chart pulled in New Case leaves the waiting fields blank until you map them.'\nWith none waiting: '{n} mapped. Every field the agents have met is mapped.'\nEach row: their field → what it fills, the system, who mapped it"

group gRes "Clinical record · Site A: 5 mapped"
  store r1 "Admit date → 'Admission date'\nReader, 03/14"
  store r2 "Primary payer → 'Payer'\nReader, 03/14"
  store r3 "Member ID → 'Member ID (masked)'\nReader, 03/14"
  store r4 "Progress note → 'Chart documents'\nReader, 03/15"
  store r5 "MAR → 'Medication record'\nReader, 03/15"
endgroup

group gOut "Clinical record · Site B: 3 mapped, 2 waiting"
  store o1 "Admit date → 'Admission date'\nReader, 03/14"
  store o2 "Primary payer → 'Payer'\nReader, 03/14"
  store o3 "Group note → 'Chart documents'\nReader, 03/16"
  input w1 "'Level of care': Not mapped, button 'Map'\nChoices: IOP or PHP"
  input w2 "'Referral source': Not mapped, button 'Map'\nChoices: Payer name, Plan type or Referring provider"
endgroup

group gBill "Billing system (both sites): 2 mapped"
  store b1 "Claim number → 'Claim reference'\nReader, 04/02"
  store b2 "Remittance date → 'Payment date'\nReader, 04/02"
endgroup

group gNew "A system just connected"
  store n1 "0 mapped, none waiting\nNothing is listed for it"
endgroup

process c1 "Waiting rows sit at the top, tinted\nA row mapped by a person goes at the end of the list\n'Mapped by' reads 'You, 10/20'"
doc d1 "Production: a versioned field map per record system, stored as data\nEvery canonical field shows its source. Changes carry a date and an author"
goto g1 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Needs a mapping › Map a field"
goto g2 "Continues in: EMR Connect › Sync › What other screens use from EMR Connect"

s1 --> t0
t0 --> r1 & o1 & b1 & n1
r1 --> r2 --> r3 --> r4 --> r5
o1 --> o2 --> o3 --> w1 --> w2
b1 --> b2
w1 --> c1
w2 --> c1
c1 --> g1
w1 -.-> g2
t0 -.-> d1
